# Corpus snapshots are committed gzipped (see app/data/README.md), which keeps every
# file well under GitHub's 100 MB limit. Git LFS is deliberately NOT used: the
# free tier allows 1 GB/month of bandwidth and the raw corpus is ~651 MB, so a
# couple of clones would exhaust it for everyone.
*.gz binary
app/data/raw/*.jsonl       text eol=lf
app/data/raw/*.tsv         text eol=lf
app/data/processed/*.jsonl text eol=lf
app/data/processed/*.tsv   text eol=lf
